  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Changing the reference to an synced array with something like\nvar tmp = (int[]) MyList.Clone();\ntmp[0] = someValue;\nMyList = tmp;\nRequestSerialization();\ndoesn't trigger onVariableChange(OnFieldChange in UdonSharp) on remote players.",
